messageValues.message:
=Classify the following Gmail message using the labels defined in the system instructions.

EmailFrom:
{{ $json.From }}

EmailTo:
{{ $json.To }}

EmailSubject:
{{ $json.Subject }}

EmailSnippet:
{{ $json.snippet }}

Email msgID (for internal use, DO NOT repeat it in your answer):
{{ $json.id }}

match between labels and labelsID :
{{ $json.combinedObject.toJsonString()}}

Le label Tagged🏷️ est obligatoire.
"🏷️"={{ $json.combinedObject['🏷️'] }}

REMINDERS:
- Choose the most appropriate labels based on the email content and context.
- Use only the allowed labels from the system message.
- Always include the label 🏷️.
- Reply ONLY with the comma-separated list of labels, nothing else.

parameters.jsCode:
const items = $input.all();
const combinedObject = items.reduce((acc, item) => {
  return { ...acc, [item.json.name]: item.json.id };
}, {});

return { combinedObject };

parameters.jsonSchemaExample:
{
    "EmailSubject": "Subject of the email for information",
	"labels": ["Work💼", "Review👀", "High🔥","Tagged🏷️"],
    "labelsID": ["ID_Work💼","ID_Review👀" ,"ID_High🔥","ID_Tagged🏷️" ],
    "msgID": "ID form message"
}
